    "labelChirho": "Nethanel (personal name)",
    "descriptionChirho": "Proper masculine name meaning 'God has given', borne by several biblical figures including the leader of Issachar during the wilderness period (Num 1:8, 2:5, 7:18,23, 10:15), a Levitical musician (1 Chr 15:24, 26:4), and others in post-exilic lists. Transliterated consistently: eng 'Nethanel/Netanel', spa 'Natanael/Netanel', arb 'نثنئيل', kor '느다넬', swa 'Nethaneli/Netaneli', hin 'नतनेल/नतनएल'. The two clusters differ only by conjunction/preposition prefixes (waw, lamed), not by referent.",
    "senseIdsChirho": [119996, 119998]
  }
